 "notes": "Map sheet (page 1); pages 2-4 are FGDC symbol-style notes that are not part of this map and were not recorded. The text layer interleaves the map face with the description of map units, so the descriptions were read with the page image and quoted from the text layer; each unit symbol was read from its box in the image. Duplin Formation: three members are proposed (Bunker Hill beds, Dovesville beds, Oakland Crossroads member); only the Bunker Hill beds are exposed in the map area; the Dovesville beds and Oakland Crossroads member are not recorded as units. Drill-hole and hand-auger labels (DILE-102 to DILE-115, DILE HA-1 to HA-3) have no data or printed locations and were not recorded. No cross section. Disclaimer and DEM/imagery references noted. SUBSURFACE: none; surface elevation ranges of QPwds (107 to 90 ft) and NPbh (163 to 107 ft) are in the descriptions.",
